<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Federal-Mogul downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Federal-Mogul downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities cut its rating on Federal-Mogul Corp to sell from hold, a source at the brokerage said.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Philip Fricke was not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
